{"unit_id":"guo-ziao__dsh-interrupt-button#feature-1","repo":"guo-ziao/dsh-interrupt-button","commit":"f91c86b720075238b9420b10b2f19b833ebae0fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-interrupt-button 的功能「强制中断」：点击输入框旁的按钮会请求停止 agent 当前回合，并尝试终止其后台任务、终端和子代理，暂停已启用的目标续跑；排队消息会保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:146-168","lib/index.js:87-127"]}
