{"unit_id":"guo-ziao__dsh-interrupt-button#caveat-1","repo":"guo-ziao/dsh-interrupt-button","commit":"f91c86b720075238b9420b10b2f19b833ebae0fd","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-interrupt-button 的使用前须知：自定义提示词只保存在浏览器模块运行期间的内存状态中，代码没有持久化到设置或文件；页面重载后会恢复默认提示词。（见 lib/client.js:35-38）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:35-38","lib/client.js:74-82"]}
